{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏好不容易有的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"好不容易有的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他转而想着还能怎样关心对方，提醒自己，真心盼对方好本身就让他开心。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心盼对方好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那份想确认自己在对方心里是否特别的紧张暂时退了，他不再计较给多少，也不怕显得更在乎，愿意多给一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿意多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是把这阵轻松当成保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情去爱，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不愿让新期待毁掉已有快乐、也不想把喜欢变成催促的意思。新期待已经绊住原有的亲近，因此他开始担心追问会搅坏这一切。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把普遍关系原则改成他主动转而想着如何关心对方，用真心盼对方好来安抚自己，保留这一想法确实让他开心的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"紧张暂退、不再计较付出、不怕显得更在乎、愿意多给，是同一轮放松带来的变化。合并后保留了慷慨给予和不再害怕自己更在乎的区别，删去重复而抽象的丰盈感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"恢复他误以为自己可以尽情去爱的投入强度，同时保留把暂时轻松当成不会失去亲近的错误保证，为下一段仍想得到回应、继而难堪留下直接前提。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [],\n      \"what\": \"删除上一轮新增的 S04-4\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得亲近已由前文和 S04-1 承接，怕给对方压力、因此收住热情又没有足够的心理前因支撑。这句没有带来独立的心理事实，删去以免把情绪退弱硬写成一次主动收回。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B2\",\n      \"why\": \"现有条目能解释自我安抚后紧张暂退、情意打开以及他愿意投入，却没有已确立的心理前因能说明这股热烈为何又悬着退弱。不把这一变化硬补成他怕给对方压力而收住。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ccbd2a7f-7afb-47d4-a7e0-5d05c78a86dc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191600058643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 312.985, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:21:13.055008+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "035ca7445de49edffb4814c16f0017854d3ad50e68287e37dd7e4b49de371989", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191600058643Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fa9b5dc6cb09f8e8986eeef5e05a37ccddda449f285cc250a6206b5219c64